:Salt|salt]]\n* 3 tbsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne pepper]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#[[Cookbook:Dredging|Dredge]] shrimp in the flour, then dip in lemon juice, then dredge in flour again. Set aside.\n#Heat oil to 375°F. [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] shrimp, 6 at a time, for 2 minutes or until deeply browned and cooked through. Drain on a [[Cookbook:Cooling Rack|wire rack]] and repeat with remaining shrimp.\n#Once all shrimp have been fried, sprinkle with seasonings and serve.\n\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using shrimp]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Tangy Fried Shrimp","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"3 pounds peeled deveined jumbo shrimp","sourceText":"3 pounds peeled deveined jumbo shrimp","amountText":"3 pounds peeled deveined jumbo shrimp","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Flour","sourceText":"Flour","amountText":"Flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Juice of 4 lemons","sourceText":"Juice of 4 lemons","amountText":"Juice of 4 lemons","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 quarts frying oil","sourceText":"3 quarts frying oil","amountText":"3 quarts frying oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 tbsp salt","sourceText":"3 tbsp salt","amountText":"3 tbsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"3 tbsp freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-li